        "after": "IRPT completion candidate:49F SMARTX primary with separate BLACK_DIAMOND verification; Cottonwood BLACK_DIAMOND and Inflection ORION. Current served provider calculations explicitly unavailable until authenticated selected-set/window proof exists. Historical September captures are offline replay only, never served as current performance. No live request, credential, endpoint, deployment or actual account capability is asserted.",
